(text "Adafruit 5825 / TL034WVS05-B1477A. Separate flex-mounted non-touch display installed by hand in J601." (at 16 155.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid ea07642f-5098-5f81-8276-d9f5208f8fc5))
(text "RGB565 drives the upper five red and blue bits and all six green bits. DB0 and DB12 are grounded." (at 16 160.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid ca64bd6a-eb91-5387-8fc0-539a54bec870))
(text "10k holds RESET low during host startup. 10k holds CS high. Place 33-ohm R605 at the host PCLK source." (at 16 165.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 99d67de4-dda3-5f4c-93a1-9f952ce4e008))
(text "ST7701S needs the TL034WVS05 three-wire 9-bit init sequence, including COLMOD 0x66." (at 16 170.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid a926a84a-e681-5625-a783-6819f2642412))
(text "Use J601 pin 1 and the actual flex contact face to verify placement before applying backlight power." (at 16 175.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 22e64d99-3e28-5fa4-9da9-f33c9ba54c68))
